msgid "LeRobot and the SO-101"
msgstr "LeRobot과 SO-101"

msgid "SO-101 leader arm used to demonstrate robot motions."
msgstr "Robot 동작을 시연하는 SO-101 leader arm입니다."

msgid "What Do I Need for This Module?"
msgstr "이 Module에 필요한 준비물"

msgid "Nothing — this module is theory-only."
msgstr "없습니다. 이 module은 이론만 다룹니다."

msgid ""
"Meet the SO-101 and the Hugging Face LeRobot tools we'll use to collect demonstrations, train "
"policies, and control the robot."
msgstr "Demonstration 수집, policy 학습, robot 제어에 사용할 SO-101과 Hugging Face LeRobot 도구를 알아봅니다."

msgid "Learning Objectives"
msgstr "학습 목표"

msgid "By the end of this session, you'll be able to:"
msgstr "이 session을 마치면 다음을 수행할 수 있습니다."

msgid "**Describe** the SO-101 robot and its capabilities"
msgstr "**Describe**: SO-101 robot과 그 기능 설명"

msgid "**Explain** the LeRobot project and its role in the robotics community"
msgstr "**Explain**: LeRobot project와 robotics community에서의 역할 설명"

msgid "**Identify** community resources for continued learning"
msgstr "**Identify**: 학습을 이어갈 community resource 확인"

msgid "The SO-101 Robot"
msgstr "SO-101 Robot"

msgid ""
"The SO-101 is a 6-DOF (degrees of freedom) robot arm designed for research and education in "
"manipulation tasks. Play the animation below to get familiar with the axes of motion."
msgstr ""
"SO-101은 manipulation 연구와 교육을 위해 설계된 6-DOF (degrees of freedom) robot arm입니다. 아래 animation을 재생해 각 "
"motion axis를 확인하세요."

msgid "The SO-101 kit has two arms:"
msgstr "SO-101 kit는 두 arm으로 구성됩니다."

msgid ""
"**Leader / Teleop arm**: You move this arm by hand to control the real or simulated follower and "
"record demonstrations."
msgstr "**Leader / Teleop arm**: 손으로 움직여 실제 또는 simulation의 follower를 제어하고 demonstration을 기록합니다."

msgid ""
"**Follower / Robot arm**: This arm performs the task. It follows the leader during teleoperation "
"or a policy during evaluation."
msgstr "**Follower / Robot arm**: task를 수행하는 arm입니다. Teleoperation 중에는 leader를, 평가 중에는 policy를 따릅니다."

msgid "LeRobot commands use `--teleop` for the leader and `--robot` for the follower."
msgstr "LeRobot 명령에서 `--teleop`는 leader, `--robot`은 follower를 지정합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "SO-101 Follower Arm"
msgstr "SO-101 Follower Arm"

msgid "The follower / robot arm performs the task."
msgstr "Follower / robot arm이 task를 수행합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "SO-101 Leader Arm"
msgstr "SO-101 Leader Arm"

msgid "The leader / teleop arm has a handle for controlling the gripper by hand."
msgstr "Leader / teleop arm에는 gripper를 손으로 제어하는 handle이 있습니다."

msgid "Why SO-101?"
msgstr "SO-101을 사용하는 이유"

msgid "The SO-101 is ideal for this learning path because:"
msgstr "SO-101은 다음 이유로 이 과정에 적합합니다."

msgid "**Accessible**: Affordable for education and research"
msgstr "**Accessible**: 교육과 연구에 적합한 가격"

msgid "**Well-documented**: Strong community support"
msgstr "**Well-documented**: 충실한 문서와 community 지원"

msgid "**LeRobot integration**: First-class support in the LeRobot ecosystem"
msgstr "**LeRobot integration**: LeRobot ecosystem의 기본 지원"

msgid "What makes it difficult for precision tasks:"
msgstr "정밀한 task를 어렵게 만드는 요인:"

msgid "**Significant backlash in the joints**"
msgstr "**Joint의 큰 Backlash**"

msgid ""
"**Joints loosen over time:** tightening the fasteners compresses the 3D-printed plastic, so "
"connections between links and motor flanges gradually lose their clamping force"
msgstr ""
"**Joints loosen over time:** Fastener를 조이면 3D-printed plastic이 압축되므로, link와 motor flange 사이의 체결력이"
" 점차 약해집니다."

msgid "The LeRobot Project"
msgstr "LeRobot Project"

msgid ""
"LeRobot is an open-source library from Hugging Face which includes tools for data collection, "
"training, robot control, and evaluation of robot policies."
msgstr "LeRobot은 Hugging Face의 open-source library로, data 수집, 학습, robot 제어, policy 평가 도구를 제공합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Community Datasets"
msgstr "Community Datasets"

msgid ""
"LeRobot hosts community-contributed datasets on the Hugging Face Hub with the LeRobot Dataset "
"Format."
msgstr "LeRobot은 Hugging Face Hub에서 LeRobot Dataset Format을 사용하는 community dataset을 제공합니다."

msgid "Thousands of robot demonstrations"
msgstr "수천 개의 robot demonstration"

msgid "Multiple robot platforms"
msgstr "다양한 robot platform"

msgid "Various manipulation tasks"
msgstr "여러 manipulation task"

msgid "Standardized formats for interoperability"
msgstr "상호 운용을 위한 표준 format"

msgid "Why LeRobot for This Course"
msgstr "이 과정에서 LeRobot을 사용하는 이유"

msgid "LeRobot is the foundation of this course for several practical reasons:"
msgstr "여러 실용적인 이유로 LeRobot을 이 과정의 기반으로 사용합니다."

msgid "Preview the collection, training, and evaluation workflow"
msgstr "수집·학습·평가 workflow 미리 보기"

msgid "Data Flow With Hugging Face Hub"
msgstr "Hugging Face Hub를 통한 Data Flow"

msgid ""
"The workshop uses one `so101-workshop` container for LeRobot tools. Simulation recording writes "
"`datasets/<repo_id>`; use the same namespace when uploading:"
msgstr ""
"Workshop은 하나의 `so101-workshop` container에서 LeRobot 도구를 사용합니다. Simulation recording 결과는 "
"`datasets/<repo_id>`에 저장됩니다. Upload할 때도 같은 namespace를 사용하세요."

msgid "Set `HF_USER` to your Hugging Face username and authenticate with `hf auth login` first."
msgstr "먼저 `HF_USER`를 본인의 Hugging Face username으로 설정하고 `hf auth login`으로 인증하세요."

msgid "For later uploads to the same dataset, {ref}`refresh its tag <refresh-dataset-tag>`."
msgstr "같은 dataset에 나중에 다시 upload할 때는 {ref}`tag를 갱신하세요 <refresh-dataset-tag>`."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Post-Training Pipeline"
msgstr "Post-Training Pipeline"

msgid ""
"Collect demonstrations with `lerobot_agent` and a leader arm, or use `vials_state_machine` for "
"[automated simulation collection](08-simulation-teleoperation.md#optional-automated-data-"
"collection). Both workflows produce LeRobot datasets under `datasets/<repo_id>`. Inspect episodes"
" with `lerobot-dataset-viz` before uploading and training."
msgstr ""
"`lerobot_agent`와 leader arm으로 demonstration을 수집하거나, `vials_state_machine`으로 [automated simulation"
" collection](08-simulation-teleoperation.md#optional-automated-data-collection)을 수행합니다. 두 "
"workflow 모두 `datasets/<repo_id>` 아래에 LeRobot dataset을 생성합니다. Upload와 학습 전에 `lerobot-dataset-viz`로"
" episode를 확인하세요."

msgid ""
"Use `lerobot-train` with `--policy.type=groot` and "
"`--policy.base_model_path=nvidia/GR00T-N1.7-3B`. [GR00T Post-Training](10-groot.md#reference-"
"post-train-your-own-model) provides the full configuration."
msgstr ""
"`lerobot-train`에 `--policy.type=groot`와 `--policy.base_model_path=nvidia/GR00T-N1.7-3B`를 지정합니다. "
"전체 설정은 [GR00T Post-Training](10-groot.md#reference-post-train-your-own-model)에 있습니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Simulation Evaluation"
msgstr "Simulation Evaluation"

msgid ""
"Use the same container terminal: start `python -m lerobot.async_inference.policy_server` in the "
"background, then run `lerobot_eval` at the prompt. The client selects the checkpoint and executes"
" the policy in Isaac Lab. [Sim Evaluation](11-sim-evaluation.md) provides the complete commands "
"and camera requirements."
msgstr ""
"같은 container terminal에서 `python -m lerobot.async_inference.policy_server`를 background로 시작한 뒤, "
"prompt에서 `lerobot_eval`을 실행합니다. Client가 checkpoint를 선택하고 Isaac Lab에서 policy를 실행합니다. 전체 명령과 camera"
" 요구사항은 [Sim Evaluation](11-sim-evaluation.md)을 확인하세요."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Real Robot Evaluation"
msgstr "Real Robot Evaluation"

msgid ""
"Use `lerobot-rollout` with the trained LeRobot policy and the follower's calibrated robot and "
"camera configuration. Follow [Real Evaluation](12-real-evaluation.md) for the command."
msgstr ""
"학습한 LeRobot policy와 calibration된 follower의 robot 및 camera 설정으로 `lerobot-rollout`을 사용합니다. 명령은 "
"[Real Evaluation](12-real-evaluation.md)을 따르세요."

msgid ""
"The workflow is collect → inspect → train → evaluate → iterate, using the shared workshop "
"environment."
msgstr "공통 workshop 환경에서 수집 → 검토 → 학습 → 평가 → 반복의 workflow를 진행합니다."

