msgid "Hugging Face Hub Integration"
msgstr "Hugging Face Hub Integration"

msgid "LeRobot leverages the Hugging Face Hub for:"
msgstr "LeRobot은 다음 용도로 Hugging Face Hub를 사용합니다."

msgid "Read more about how this course uses Hugging Face"
msgstr "이 과정의 Hugging Face 활용 방법 자세히 보기"

msgid "How We Used Hugging Face in This Course"
msgstr "이 과정에서 Hugging Face를 활용한 방법"

msgid "**1. Dataset format for gathering demonstrations**"
msgstr "**1. Demonstration 수집용 Dataset Format**"

msgid ""
"We used the LeRobot dataset format for all teleoperation and state machine (procedurally "
"generated) data. Episodes are stored with observations (e.g. camera images), robot state, and "
"actions in a consistent schema. Simulation recording uses `lerobot_agent --repo_id` and derives "
"the local path as `datasets/<repo_id>`. Real recording uses `lerobot-record` with "
"`--dataset.repo_id` and an explicit `--dataset.root`."
msgstr ""
"모든 teleoperation 및 state machine 기반 procedural data에 LeRobot dataset format을 사용했습니다. Episode는 "
"observation(예: camera image), robot state, action을 일관된 schema로 저장합니다. Simulation recording은 "
"`lerobot_agent --repo_id`를 사용하며 local 경로는 `datasets/<repo_id>`로 정해집니다. Real recording은 `lerobot-"
"record`에 `--dataset.repo_id`와 명시적인 `--dataset.root`를 지정합니다."

msgid "**2. Sharing datasets**"
msgstr "**2. Dataset 공유**"

msgid ""
"Datasets were pushed to the Hugging Face Hub so they could be reused for training, shared with "
"others, and versioned. We used `--dataset.repo_id=${HF_USER}/dataset_name` and "
"`--dataset.push_to_hub=true` when recording, or `hf upload` for existing local datasets. The "
"[LeRobot Dataset Visualizer](https://huggingface.co/spaces/lerobot/visualize_dataset) on the Hub "
"was used to inspect episodes and verify quality before training."
msgstr ""
"학습 재사용, 공유, version 관리를 위해 dataset을 Hugging Face Hub에 push했습니다. Recording 시 "
"`--dataset.repo_id=${HF_USER}/dataset_name`과 `--dataset.push_to_hub=true`를 사용하거나, 기존 local "
"dataset에는 `hf upload`를 사용했습니다. 학습 전에 Hub의 [LeRobot Dataset "
"Visualizer](https://huggingface.co/spaces/lerobot/visualize_dataset)로 episode와 품질을 확인했습니다."

msgid "**3. Merging datasets for co-training (sim + real, sim + Cosmos)**"
msgstr "**3. Co-Training용 Dataset Merge(sim + real, sim + Cosmos)**"

msgid ""
"For co-training we combined multiple data sources into a single training dataset or ran multiple "
"passesof training."
msgstr "Co-training을 위해 여러 data source를 하나의 training dataset으로 합치거나 여러 차례 학습을 진행했습니다."

msgid "**4. Sharing evaluations**"
msgstr "**4. 평가 결과 공유**"

msgid ""
"Evaluation results and policy checkpoints were shared via the Hub. Trained models were uploaded "
"(e.g. as GR00T checkpoints or LeRobot policy repos) so others could reproduce evaluations or run "
"the same policy in sim and on the real robot. Links to specific datasets and model repos were "
"used in this learning path to align everyone on the same baselines and co-trained models."
msgstr ""
"평가 결과와 policy checkpoint를 Hub로 공유했습니다. GR00T checkpoint 또는 LeRobot policy repo 등의 형태로 model을 "
"upload해 다른 사람도 평가를 재현하거나 simulation과 실제 robot에서 같은 policy를 실행할 수 있도록 했습니다. 이 과정의 dataset과 model "
"repo 링크는 모두가 같은 baseline과 co-trained model을 사용하도록 연결합니다."

msgid "Key Takeaways"
msgstr "핵심 내용"

msgid "SO-101 is an accessible, well-supported robot for learning sim-to-real"
msgstr "SO-101은 sim-to-real 학습에 적합하며 접근성과 지원이 좋은 robot입니다."

msgid "LeRobot provides open-source tools, datasets, and models"
msgstr "LeRobot은 open-source 도구, dataset, model을 제공합니다."

msgid "The Hugging Face community offers ongoing support and resources"
msgstr "Hugging Face community에서 지속적인 지원과 자료를 얻을 수 있습니다."

msgid "You're joining a growing community of robot learners and practitioners"
msgstr "계속 성장하는 robot 학습자와 실무자 community에 함께 참여할 수 있습니다."

msgid "What's Next?"
msgstr "다음 단계"

msgid ""
"Next, [Building the Workspace](05-building-workspace.md) walks through assembling and lighting "
"the physical lightbox and task props. After that, [Calibrating the SO-101](07-calibrating-"
"so101.md) covers power-on and calibration, and [Teleoperating](08-operating-so101.md) covers "
"teleoperation and camera setup."
msgstr ""
"다음 [Building the Workspace](05-building-workspace.md)에서 실제 lightbox와 task 소품의 조립 및 조명을 준비합니다. 이어서"
" [Calibrating the SO-101](07-calibrating-so101.md)에서 전원 연결과 calibration을, [Teleoperating](08"
"-operating-so101.md)에서 teleoperation과 camera 설정을 다룹니다."

msgid ""
"Continue to [Calibrating the SO-101](07-calibrating-so101.md) with the prepared event workspace. "
"Follow your instructor's directions about calibration, then continue to [Teleoperating](08"
"-operating-so101.md)."
msgstr ""
"준비된 행사 workspace에서 [Calibrating the SO-101](07-calibrating-so101.md)으로 이동하세요. Calibration은 "
"instructor의 안내에 따르고, 이어서 [Teleoperating](08-operating-so101.md)을 진행하세요."

